{"meta":{"id":"format-function","category":"it/syntax/jsp/jstl","title":"포맷 · 함수 (fmt · fn) · JSP","subtitle":"(JSP · JSTL · EL)","summary":"fmt:formatNumber · formatDate, fn:replace 로 줄바꿈 처리, fn:length 등","tags":["jsp","f-format"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>JSP · JSTL · EL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">포맷 · 함수 (fmt · fn) · JSP</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> fmt:formatNumber · formatDate, fn:replace 로 줄바꿈 처리, fn:length 등</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">fmt — 숫자 · 날짜 포맷</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;fmt:formatNumber value=&quot;${won}&quot; /&gt;                        &lt;!-- 1,234,567 천 단위 --&gt;\r\n&lt;fmt:formatNumber value=&quot;${rate}&quot; pattern=&quot;#,##0.0&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;fmt:formatDate value=&quot;${today}&quot; pattern=&quot;yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm&quot; /&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">fn — 함수 (줄바꿈 → &lt;br/&gt;)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;% pageContext.setAttribute(&quot;newLine&quot;, &quot;\\n&quot;); %&gt;          &lt;!-- java 줄바꿈 문자를 변수로 --&gt;\r\n${fn:replace(vo.content, newLine, &#x27;&lt;br/&gt;&#x27;)}               &lt;!-- 저장된 \\n 을 화면 줄바꿈으로 --&gt;\r\n\r\n${fn:length(vos)}   ${fn:substring(title, 0, 10)}   ${fn:contains(mid, &#x27;admin&#x27;)}\r\n${fn:split(cards, &#x27;/&#x27;)[0]}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › 문자열 포맷</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jsp/jstl/format-function","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jsp","title":"JSP · JSTL · EL","path":"it/syntax/jsp"},{"id":"jstl","title":"JSTL","path":"it/syntax/jsp/jstl"}],"hasImage":false}